Archmage '''Ansirem Runeweaver''' is a [[human]] [[quest giver]] located in [[Dalaran]] in the [[Alterac Mountains]]. He is a current leading member of the [[Kirin Tor]] and is leading the process of the reconstruction of Dalaran. He has a daughter, [[Catelyn the Blade]], who decided to become a pirate and joined the [[Blackwater Raiders]].

At some point, he worked with Baron Revilgaz. He once visited Stranglethorn and found a troll relic, a blade, and later gave it to Catelyn who ran with it off.

